  "evidencia": "Page: Natalie Martinez. Sentence: Natalie Martinez (born July 12, 1984) is an American actress and model.\nPage: Natalie Martinez. Sentence: She is known as the spokes-model for JLO by Jennifer Lopez, and for her role in the 2008 feature film \"Death Race\".\nPage: Death Race (film). Sentence: Death Race is a 2008 American-German-British science fiction action thriller film produced, written, and directed by Paul W. S. Anderson and starring Jason Statham.\nPage: The Land (2016 film). Sentence: The film stars Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Moisés Arias, Rafi Gavron, Ezri Walker, Kim Coates, Linda Emond, Natalie Martinez, Machine Gun Kelly, Erykah Badu and Michael K. Williams.\nPage: Jongnic Bontemps. Sentence: He is the music director for 2016 film \"The Land\".",
