        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natalie Martinez, Paul W. S. Anderson, Jason Statham, Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Moisés Arias, Rafi Gavron, Ezri Walker, Kim Coates, Linda Emond, Machine Gun Kelly, Erykah Badu, Michael K. Williams, Jongnic Bontemps, Jennifer Lopez\n- Films: Death Race, The Land\n- Roles: actress, model, spokes-model, music director\n\nFacts:\n- Natalie Martinez was born on July 12, 1984, and she is an American actress and model.\n- Natalie Martinez was the spokes-model for JLO by Jennifer Lopez.\n- Death Race is a 2008 American-German-British science fiction action thriller film produced, written, and directed by Paul W. S. Anderson, and it stars Jason Statham.\n- Natalie Martinez is known for her role in the 2008 feature film Death Race.\n- The 2016 film The Land stars Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Moisés Arias, Rafi Gavron, Ezri Walker, Kim Coates, Linda Emond, Natalie Martinez, Machine Gun Kelly, Erykah Badu, and Michael K. Williams.\n- Jongnic Bontemps is the music director for the 2016 film The Land.",
